{"version":1,"key":"card:32","content":{"id":32,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"意志力不是由心灵力量控制，而是由大脑控制，在英国有个工人，工人的意志力很好，有一次事故，前额皮质受到了损坏，虽然得以康复，但是性情大变，易怒易躁，这说明是大脑在控制你的意志力。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d2a9df5e-243e-432e-baeb-ccb78424ac00","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"意志力会受到哪些因素影响：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ae8828d5-0fa4-421e-896d-e58581a30b33","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"身体极限","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7c087010-fa24-43cf-a220-d13865ac9bfc","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"当身体来到极限时，大脑的能量不足，各项功能受到限制，从而使得意志力下降","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"23ccc4f2-6a2f-4268-9b9c-436e7d3425e9","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"95b7fce8-71d0-46bd-bc0e-3bbc9f3693f9","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"道德许可","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cc4be0ec-2497-4b27-95a0-088ae2cea839","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在做出阶段性成果时，我们会允许自己是做一些破坏意志力的事情，比如买买买，吃吃吃，并且觉得这没有什么不对，是自己对自己的一种奖励","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dda98b78-ec65-4f98-ace1-d3e8cdb6cdd4","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"30669e47-68fc-4ec7-bf96-6e997954c8b7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"失控","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c62aa107-2abc-4864-b32a-c46e0214116e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在遭受一系列打击后，处于失控状态，此时产生了破罐子破摔的想法，无法节制自己","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4059cf86-992e-45bd-bfa6-41918972c920","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7be673d5-4d69-403e-9575-9824c00f23e1","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"群体效应","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b2c81915-3270-44f4-ac26-7d4c4ae890fd","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"看着别人也在干，自己也跟着做了起来","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a02d1e01-9bd0-40f8-90f7-98d96e63f3f1","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6117afec-bc79-4b49-b6a3-413c02962275","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b3915f00-6163-42f2-885b-f5b26a251784","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"如何提高意志力：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cd3e3be4-a123-4a7d-a5d9-db01ad82dea8","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":" 冥想与呼吸","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"efa64bae-ba09-42e1-8544-b3c349dfef90","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"冥想：减轻大脑压力","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"522e71db-2e5a-434a-acb6-65dbd7d79a37","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"19023469-64d2-4a74-b82f-e49913a620ca","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"呼吸：把呼吸频率降低到每分钟 4~6 次，有利于激活大脑前额皮质","